---
interface Props {
  updated: Date;
}

const { updated } = Astro.props;
const updatedLabel = updated.toLocaleDateString("zh-TW", {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "2-digit",
  day: "2-digit",
});
---

<section class="about-overview" aria-labelledby="about-introduction-title">
  <div class="about-overview__intro">
    <span class="about-overview__eyebrow">STUDENT · COMPETITIVE PROGRAMMING</span>
    <h2 id="about-introduction-title">Hello World，我是 Flashingtw！</h2>
    <p>
      我是大安高工電子科的學生，目前擔任大安電研社社長。我喜歡從程式邏輯中找出規律，主要投入演算法、資料結構與競技程式設計。
    </p>
    <p>
      我從 2025 年 8 月開始學習 C++，並在一次次檢測與競賽中修正不足、累積經驗。這裡記錄我的成果，也保留一路上的反思。
    </p>

    <div class="about-overview__actions">
      <a href="https://github.com/Flashingtw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <i class="i-ri-github-fill" aria-hidden="true" />
        查看 GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:0624joshua@gmail.com" class="about-overview__secondary-action">
        <i class="i-ri-mail-line" aria-hidden="true" />
        聯絡我
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="about-overview__updated">
      <i class="i-ri-refresh-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      最後更新：<time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{updatedLabel}</time>
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="about-facts" aria-label="個人快速資訊">
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-code-s-slash-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>主要語言</span>
      <strong>C++</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-calendar-check-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>開始學習</span>
      <strong>2025.08</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-team-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>目前身分</span>
      <strong>大安電研社社長</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-focus-3-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>專注方向</span>
      <strong>演算法與競程</strong>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="about-focus" aria-labelledby="about-focus-title">
  <div class="about-section-heading">
    <span class="about-section-heading__icon">
      <i class="i-ri-compass-3-line" aria-hidden="true" />
    </span>
    <div>
      <h2 id="about-focus-title">目前正在做的事</h2>
      <p>比起只列出會什麼，我更想記錄自己正在往哪裡走。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="about-focus__list">
    <li>準備成大邀請賽決賽與後續程式競賽</li>
    <li>持續練習演算法、資料結構與競賽解題</li>
    <li>把解題過程與參賽心得整理成文章</li>
    <li>帶領大安電研社進行技術交流與共同學習</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .about-overview {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(15rem, 0.75fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color-muted);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cb-focus-bg), transparent 48%), var(--box-bg-shadow);
    padding: 1.6rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-soft);
  }

  .about-overview__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .about-overview__intro h2 {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .about-overview__intro > p:not(.about-overview__updated) {
    margin: 0.45rem 0;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-overview__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-overview__actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-blue);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-blue);
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    color: var(--grey-0);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-overview__actions .about-overview__secondary-action {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .about-overview__updated {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.7rem;
    align-content: start;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .about-facts > li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--line-hover-bg);
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-facts > li::before,
  .about-focus__list > li::before {
    display: none;
    content: none;
  }

  .about-facts i {
    grid-row: span 2;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-facts span {
    color: var(--text-color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .about-facts strong {
    color: var(--text-color);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .about-focus {
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section-heading__icon {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--cb-focus-bg);
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .about-section-heading h2,
  .about-section-heading p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-section-heading p {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .about-focus__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .about-focus__list > li {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color-muted);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem 0.85rem 2rem;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-focus__list > li::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.15rem;
    left: 0.85rem;
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-blue);
    content: "";
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-overview {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 1.15rem;
    }

    .about-focus__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 340px) {
    .about-facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
